# Local dev against production content (#98): copy to .env.cms, then `pnpm dev:cms`.
# Vite reads .env first and this file on top, so only these values change.
# STRAPI_TOKEN: a separate read-only token, "local-dev-read" (docs/infrastructure.md → Local dev
# against production content). Never the Worker's token.
STRAPI_URL=https://cms.bhargavshukla.com
STRAPI_TOKEN=
# PREVIEW_SECRET stays the local one from .env. Never copy the production secret here.
